# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Whitelist-based .gitignore
# デフォルト全除外 → OSS公開対象のみ許可
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Step 1: 全て除外
*

# Step 2: ディレクトリの探索を許可（中身は個別に許可）
!*/

# Step 3: OSS公開対象ファイルを許可
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!.gitleaks.toml
!CLAUDE.md
!LICENSE
!README.md
!README_ja.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!SECURITY.md

# Claude Code settings (spinner verbs only, no secrets)
!.claude/
!.claude/settings.json

# Codex CLI settings (cmd_757④redo1, 2026-09-09: hooks.jsonは個人環境の絶対パスを含むため生成物として除外し、テンプレートのみ追跡する)
!.codex/
!.codex/hooks.json.template

# Instructions (core OSS)
!instructions/
!instructions/shogun.md
!instructions/karo.md
!instructions/ashigaru.md
!instructions/gunshi.md

